        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 21:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Yeremia, omugabe Zedekia aharize kuragaana n'ab'omuri Yerusaalemu endagaano y'okubarangira eby'okurekura abahuuku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.39+LEV.25.40+LEV.25.41+LEV.25.42+LEV.25.43+LEV.25.44+LEV.25.45+LEV.25.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 25:39-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.5.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 5:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ngu buri muntu weena arekure abahuuku be n'abazaana be b'Abaheburaayo, harekye kubaho omuntu weena owaagira mwene waabo Omuyudaaya omuhuuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boona baagyorobera; abanyiginya boona n'abantu boona abaaragaine egyo ndagaano erikugira ngu buri muntu arekure omuhuuku we n'omuzaana we, barekye kugaruka kuza omu buhuuku; boona baabyorobera, baabarekura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka bwanyima baahinduka, baagarura abo bahuuku n'abazaana abu baarekwire, baabagarura omu buhuuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Nkaragaana na baashwenkuriimwe, obu naabaiha omu nsi ya Misri omu nju y'obuhuuku, ningira nti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 15:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahari buri muheru gw'emyaka mukaaga, buri muntu omuriimwe aryarekura Omuheburaayo mugyenzi we ou yaaguziibwe, omazire emyaka mukaaga naamukorera; aryamurekura arugye omu buhuuku. Kwonka baashwenkuriimwe tibarampuriire n'obu kwakuba okuntega amatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 23:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebiro ebi mweteisize, mwakora ebi ndikusiima, mwaranga obusingye, buri muntu yaagambira mugyenzi we eby'okurekurwa, mwaraganira endagaano omu maisho gangye omu nju erikwetererwa eiziina ryangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka muhindukire, mwajumisa eiziina ryangye, buri muntu omuriimwe yaagarura abahuuku be n'abazaana be, abu mubaire murekwire, nk'oku babaire nibenda, mwabagarura omu buhuuku kuba abahuuku n'abazaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
